    {
      "name": "Devil's Breath",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "fire"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The Devil's Disciple cuts their tongue with a slashing weapon held in a hand (taking 1 Slashing Damage damage), then exhales a 15ft Cone of burning smoke. Each creature in the area must attempt a DC 18 Reflex Saving Throw save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes 1d8 Fire Damage damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes 2d8 Fire Damage damage and is Sickened 1 by the agonizing pain of the burns.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes 4d8 Fire Damage damage, is sickened 1 by the agonizing pain of the burns, and is Enfeebled 1 by the smoke for 1 minute.</p>",
